SUMMARY:New Jersey — extended Data Center Fair Share Act responses
DESCRIPTION:Respond to the request for information on implementation of the
  Data Center Fair Share Act\, including electric-distribution-company tari
 ff requirements for large data centers. Use the docket's Post Comments pro
 cess or the alternative channel specified by the notice\; reference EO2608
 0463. Verify the current instructions before submitting.\nProceeding: njbp
 u-eo26080463\nAgency: New Jersey Board of Public Utilities\nProject phase:
  Policy consultation on large-data-center utility service and tariffs\; no
 t a facility permit or final tariff\nRecord status: active\nOfficial sourc
 e: https://nj.gov/bpu/pdf/publicnotice/Notice%20to%20Extend%20Comment%20Pe
 riod.pdf\nSource checked: 2026-11-18\nAll-day calendar marker for the list
 ed date\, not a verified closing clock time. Confirm the clock time\, time
  zone\, extensions and submission rules with the agency.\nThe extension st
 ates 5 p.m. on December 14\, replacing November 13 at 5 p.m. Neither notic
 e explicitly names the time zone. The calendar export is date-only. Confir
 m the time zone with BPU and submit before the stated closing time\; an al
 l-day calendar marker is not permission to submit until midnight.\nOfficia
 l participation instructions: https://www.nj.gov/bpu/pdf/publicnotice/Webp
 osting-Notice-EO26080463-%20Data%20Center%20Fair%20Share%20Act%20RFI.pdf\n
 Find and review the records: https://clinical-trials.github.io/datacenter/
 site/?proceeding=nj-fair-share-comments&prepare=records#citizen\nPrepare a
  public comment: https://clinical-trials.github.io/datacenter/site/?procee
 ding=nj-fair-share-comments&prepare=comment#citizen\nCalendar reminders ar
 e personal preparation prompts\, not legal filing deadlines. All-day remin
 der timing follows the recipient calendar time zone\; confirm settings aft
 er adding. Recheck the official notice before acting.
URL:https://nj.gov/bpu/pdf/publicnotice/Notice%20to%20Extend%20Comment%20Pe
 riod.pdf
